<title>USA: Nets Inc names president.</title>
<headline>Nets Inc names president.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Privately held Nets Inc said it had named Catherine Hapka, a former executive vice president of U S West Communications Inc, as president of the company.</p>
<p>Hapka will report to Nets Inc chairman Jim Manzi, the former chief executive at Lotus Development Corp, who resigned a few months after International Business Machines Corp acquired Lotus in 1995.</p>
<p>Hapka, 42, will assume her role as president on March 3. She will be responsible for operations and for developing strategies to grow the business.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
